    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You take a deep breath and spew molten cinders along a 120-foot-long, 10-foot-wide Line originating from you in a direction you choose. Each creature in the Line makes a Dexterity saving throw, taking 12d6 Fire damage on a failure or half as much on a success.</p><p>You then teleport to an unoccupied space within 5 feet of the end of the Line.</p>",
